# Files in the repo root that should not be served publicly.
# The assets directory is "./", so without this they'd be reachable over HTTP.

# Repository internals. Wrangler walks the whole directory, so without
# these the deploy publishes .git/config, .git/index and the object
# store — i.e. the entire history, downloadable from the live site.
.git
.gitignore
.wrangler

wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
README.md
tools
Animation.mp4
cv-mohit-amazon-2026-07-27.tex
